@startuml
title Use Case 4.1: Medical Record Create
actor User
participant MedicalRecords.vue
participant medicalRecords.ts
participant medical_records.py
participant medical_record_service.py
database MySQL

User -> MedicalRecords.vue: Select animal
MedicalRecords.vue -> MedicalRecords.vue: Show create form
User -> MedicalRecords.vue: Fill record data
User -> MedicalRecords.vue: Click Save
MedicalRecords.vue -> medicalRecords.ts: createMedicalRecord()
medicalRecords.ts -> medical_records.py: POST /animals/{id}/medical-records
medical_records.py -> medical_record_service.py: create_medical_record()
medical_record_service.py -> MySQL: INSERT INTO medical_records
MySQL --> medical_record_service.py: record_id
medical_record_service.py --> medical_records.py: record
medical_records.py --> medicalRecords.ts: 201 Created
medicalRecords.ts --> MedicalRecords.vue: success
MedicalRecords.vue --> User: Success message
@enduml